A parcel held whole because it could not be split is moved whole when its
holder dies, like a parcel whose nodes share their blocker. Its nodes do
not: the ones no version reaches any more stay parked on the next version
instead of being freed.
Guarded-by: "alloc sweep: a parcel held whole is split when its holder dies"

